      "key": "arena-dano",
      "prompt": "Use case: identity-preserve. Production 2D sprite sheet. Use the reference image as exact identity, detailed hand-painted style, face, brown pigtails, bows, cream/pink dress, brown boots and wooden sword/cyan guard. All poses face RIGHT, same head size and scale. Serious determined face: narrowed eyes and eyebrows tilted down towards center. NO smile except hurt flinch naturally closes eyes. Full body, generous transparent margins and gaps, genuine alpha transparency, NO floor/ground/shadow/backdrop, NO text/grid or motion effects. Exactly SIX frames, THREE columns by TWO rows. A continuous hit-reaction sequence: 1 sudden small startle, shoulders recoil; 2 stronger backward recoil, knees start bending; 3 peak hit with eyes shut and face showing pain, sword dropping slightly; 4 held peak with torso back and one knee buckling; 5 rebalancing forward, opens determined eyes, regains footing; 6 almost recovered guard, still tense. SIX visibly distinct articulated poses, not duplicates. Same character size, consistent boot baseline, natural weight transfer. No blood, no injuries or violent gore."
    },
    {
      "key": "arena-agachar",
      "prompt": "Use case: identity-preserve. Production 2D sprite sheet. Use the reference image as exact identity, detailed hand-painted style, face, brown pigtails, bows, cream/pink dress, brown boots and wooden sword/cyan guard. All poses face RIGHT, same head size and scale. Serious determined face: narrowed eyes and eyebrows tilted down towards center. NO smile except hurt flinch naturally closes eyes. Full body, generous transparent margins and gaps, genuine alpha transparency, NO floor/ground/shadow/backdrop, NO text/grid or motion effects. Exactly FOUR frames in TWO columns by TWO rows. A controlled crouch transition: frame1 slight bend in knees (body 90% standing height); frame2 half squat (body 78% standing height); frame3 low squat (body 67% standing height); frame4 VERY DEEP DUCKING SQUAT, knees near chest, hips close to heels, torso leaning forward with elbows bent, body only 60% of standing height. CRITICAL: HEAD is exactly SAME PIXEL SIZE in ALL FOUR frames! Fold the legs and trunk deeply instead of scaling down the girl. All four poses must have head tops at progressively lower heights relative to the feet; common boot baseline in each cell. Sword pointed diagonally forward at waist level. The deepest pose needs to fit UNDER an enemy's chest-height punch. Not kneeling, not seated on floor. Do not give all four sprites the same height."
    }
  ]
